spans.s:
(cf. √ लक्ष्, लक्ष &c.) cl. 1. P. (Dhātup. xix, 24) लगति (accord. to Nir. iv, 10 also लग्यति; pf. ललाग Gr.; aor. अलगीत्, ib.; fut. लगिता, ib.; लगिष्यति, Pañcat.; ind.p. लगित्वा, -लग्य, Kāv.),
to adhere, stick, cling or attach one's self to (loc.), MBh.; Kāv. &c. (with हृदि and gen., ‘to penetrate to a person's heart’, Kathās.);
to take effect upon (loc.), Śiś.;
to meet, come in contact, cut (as lines), Gol., Sch.;
to follow closely, ensue or happen immediately, Kathās.;
to pass away (as time), Pañcat. :
Caus. orCaus. लगयति, or cl. 10. (Dhātup. xxxiii, 63) लागयति, ‘to taste’ or ‘to obtain’ (आस्वादने, or आसादने). [In Hindī this root often means ‘to begin’.]
